  "description": "Merged 6 ibm security advisories published on 2026-08-04. Original advisory IDs: IBM-7282567, IBM-7282530, IBM-7282517, IBM-7282529, IBM-7282484, IBM-7282528\n\nTitles:\n- Multiple Vulnerabilities in IBM API Connect\n- IBM WebSphere Application Server and WebSphere Application Server Liberty, which are bundled with IBM Cloud Pak for Applications, are affected by a security bypass vulnerability (CVE-2026-10842)\n- Multiple Vulnerabilities in IBM Cloud Pak System\n- IBM WebSphere Application Server and WebSphere Application Server Liberty, which are bundled with IBM Enterprise Application Runtimes, are affected by a security bypass vulnerability (CVE-2026-10842)\n- IBM Maximo Application Suite - Visual Inspection component uses tar which is vulnerable to CVE-2026-53655\n- IBM WebSphere Application Server and WebSphere Application Server Liberty, which are bundled with IBM WebSphere Hybrid Edition, are affected by a security bypass vulnerability (CVE-2026-10842)",
